 TED - The Tiny Editor                                                 Keys

 Arrows               Move the cursor
 Home  End            Go to the start or the end of the line
 PgUp  PgDn           Move 29 lines
 Enter                Split the line
 Tab                  Put in a tab
 Backspace            Take out the selection, or the character before it
 Del                  Take out the selection, or the character under the cursor

 Shift+Arrows         Select
 Shift+Home  End      Select to the start or the end of the line
 Shift+PgUp  PgDn     Select 29 lines
 ^C                   Copy the selection, or the line
 ^X                   Cut the selection, or the line
 ^V                   Paste

 ^S                   Save
 ^Q                   Quit
 F1  ^G               This help
 Shift+F1             DOS help on the word at the cursor

 Press a key to go back to the text.
